        <briefdescription>
<para>Logical <computeroutput>&amp;&amp;</computeroutput> (and) operator. Matches only if at least one operand is a framework type (see <computeroutput><ref refid="conceptmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1extension_1_1is__op" kindref="compound">extension::is_op</ref></computeroutput>). </para>
